-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under AT-C Section 320.35, the service auditor evaluates how the service organization''s controls interact with complementary user entity controls (CUECs) and complementary subservice organization controls (CSOCs) to collectively achieve the control objective. The auditor identifies expected complementary controls and assesses design assumptions.
Wrong (B): The service auditor does not test whether user entities have implemented CUECs. That responsibility belongs to the user entity''s own auditor.
Wrong (C): Evaluating financial statement accuracy under GAAP is outside the scope of a SOC 2 engagement, which focuses on trust services criteria rather than financial reporting.
